From fd469a1d2372945584eb939f773c76397898a092 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nova <361320585+q2-nova@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:36:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] drm: add X2000 direct composer, DSI and Shanling Q2 panel

Recover the fixed 320x375 video mode, panel command tables, rails, reset sequence and PHY setup from the stock Q2 modules, cross-checked against Ingenic SDK registers. Use atomic DRM with two descriptor sets and chain-site-confirmed page flips, DMA GEM buffers and the DesignWare DSI bridge. Expose the standard backlight and DSI connector interfaces. No overlays, scaling or physical hardware qualification is claimed.
---
